[agent:result] def _segments(command: str) -> list:
[agent:result]     """Token lists for each shell segment (separators dropped).
[agent:result] 
[agent:result]     Thin wrapper over `_pipeline_segments` — same quote/redirect-aware split,
[agent:result]     minus the trailing operator. Keeping one parser means quote/redirect bugs
[agent:result]     are fixed in a single place, and `_segments` inherits the redirect-`&`
[agent:result]     awareness (`2>&1` stays glued instead of splitting into a bogus segment).
